<title>FRANCE: Port conditions update - France - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - France - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>FRANCE, July 11 - Marseille - CMR (Compagnie de Marseillaise de Reparations) staff went on strike yesterday. They prevented people from entering/leaving the port. The strike followed a tribunal's decision to allow Swiss interests to take over the company.</p>
</text>
